# INVWIN4.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the service
# records by level.  At level 1, in the recent list, CTRL+E and DEL show
# INV's refusal in a message box, ENTER still shows a record in view
# mode and INS does nothing; in item 1's records INS shows the refusal
# too.  After File > Log out, at level 2, item 2 has no records,
# where ENTER, CTRL+E and DEL do nothing and INS shows a new record, and
# CTRL+E in the recent list edits; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN4.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I E
K CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER DEL
S NODEL
K ENTER ENTER
S VIEW
K ENTER INS
S NOINS
K ESC ALT-C S INS
S NONEW
K ENTER ESC ALT-F L
K STAB
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER DOWN ALT-C S
S EMPTY
K ENTER CTRL-E DEL
S NOKEYS
K INS
S NEW
K ESC ESC ALT-I E CTRL-E
S EDIT
K ESC ESC ALT-F X
